Transactions clamp pages past the end.

========== API ==========

transactions({ order: 'newest', page: 99, pageSize: 2 })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Expenses:Shop

2024-01-01 First
  Assets:Cash  10 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -10 SEK

2024-01-02 Second
  Assets:Cash  20 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -20 SEK

2024-01-03 Shop | Third  ; imported
  ; Project: Home
  Assets:Cash  -5 SEK  ; card
  Expenses:Shop

